# The sandbox-image build context is the REPO ROOT (M3-PK-01): the image ships
# the skill executor bundled from packages/skill-runtime, and reads the esbuild
# pin from apps/desktop/package.json. Everything below is local state the build
# must never read — keeping it out keeps the image build reproducible and the
# context small.
.git
# Dokploy writes production secrets to infra/dokploy/.env in the build context.
# Never COPY any env file into an image.
.env*
**/.env*
node_modules
**/node_modules
.turbo
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/release
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.artifacts
*.log
# A local `next build`, which the image builds afresh.
**/.next
